        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The little chicken is in danger in this fast and funny puzzle platformer and you’re its only hope!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this fast block puzzle game, you need to place all the blocks on the grid or the chicken meets an untimely end. No falling shapes in this thinking puzzle game and no rotations. Just pure placement pressure! Think fast, act faster, and save the little chicken!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Luckily, you’re not alone. Catch flying balloons to lift the chick to safety and beat the level in style,  or drop corn seeds to buy a few extra moments while your chick snacks its way to survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every second counts in this addictive puzzle platformer full of charm, speed, and a hint of roasted chicken!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you like block puzzle games that are a real brain teaser, then this funny chicken fast logic puzzle platformer is perfect for you!</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The little chicken is in danger in this fast and funny puzzle platformer and you’re its only hope!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this fast block puzzle game, you need to place all the blocks on the grid or the chicken meets an untimely end. No falling shapes in this thinking puzzle game and no rotations. Just pure placement pressure! Think fast, act faster, and save the little chicken!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Luckily, you’re not alone. Catch flying balloons to lift the chick to safety and beat the level in style,  or drop corn seeds to buy a few extra moments while your chick snacks its way to survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every second counts in this addictive puzzle platformer full of charm, speed, and a hint of roasted chicken!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you like block puzzle games that are a real brain teaser, then this funny chicken fast logic puzzle platformer is perfect for you!</p>",
        "short_description": "A fresh twist on block puzzle games. Quick rounds, smart moves, instant fun! This is not your grandma tetris!",
